 "turns": [
  {
   "turn_id": "C16-D001",
   "turn_index": 0,
   "speaker": "林梅",
   "source_text": "おはようございます。今日は早いですね。道は大丈夫でしたか。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C16-D001-S01",
    "C16-D001-S02",
    "C16-D001-S03"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-concierge-7",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 0.0,
   "end_sec": 5.125,
   "duration_sec": 5.125
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C16-D002",
   "turn_index": 1,
   "speaker": "マテオ",
   "source_text": "初めは反対の方向へ行きました。案内所で尋ねて、やっと着きました。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C16-D002-S01",
    "C16-D002-S02"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-commercial-4",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 5.475,
   "end_sec": 10.814,
   "duration_sec": 5.339
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C16-D003",
   "turn_index": 2,
   "speaker": "林梅",
   "source_text": "こっちが教室です。まず、窓を開けましょう。私は窓を開けて、マテオさんは順番を黒板に書いてください。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C16-D003-S01",
    "C16-D003-S02",
    "C16-D003-S03"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-concierge-7",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 11.164,
   "end_sec": 19.459,
   "duration_sec": 8.295
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C16-D004",
   "turn_index": 3,
   "speaker": "マテオ",
   "source_text": "はい。書いた後で、携帯電話で黒板の写真を撮ります。後で家でも見ます。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C16-D004-S01",
    "C16-D004-S02",
    "C16-D004-S03"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-commercial-4",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 19.809,
   "end_sec": 25.318,
   "duration_sec": 5.509
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C16-D005",
   "turn_index": 4,
   "speaker": "林梅",
   "source_text": "いいですね。ノートパソコンもありますか。今日は何を読みますか。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C16-D005-S01",
    "C16-D005-S02",
    "C16-D005-S03"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-concierge-7",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 25.668,
   "end_sec": 32.266,
   "duration_sec": 6.598
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C16-D006",
   "turn_index": 5,
   "speaker": "マテオ",
   "source_text": "はい。朝ご飯の支度の説明を書きました。先に湯を沸かして、お茶を入れます。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C16-D006-S01",
    "C16-D006-S02",
    "C16-D006-S03"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-commercial-4",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 32.616,
   "end_sec": 38.791,
   "duration_sec": 6.175
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C16-D007",
   "turn_index": 6,
   "speaker": "林梅",
   "source_text": "私は毎朝、パンと卵を食べます。朝の支度は短いです。今日は宿題もしました。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C16-D007-S01",
    "C16-D007-S02",
    "C16-D007-S03"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-concierge-7",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 39.141,
   "end_sec": 47.245,
   "duration_sec": 8.104
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C16-D008",
   "turn_index": 7,
   "speaker": "マテオ",
   "source_text": "どうして今朝、宿題をしましたか。昨日は忙しかったですか。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C16-D008-S01",
    "C16-D008-S02"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-commercial-4",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 47.595,
   "end_sec": 52.022,
   "duration_sec": 4.427
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C16-D009",
   "turn_index": 8,
   "speaker": "林梅",
   "source_text": "はい。昨日は疲れて、すぐ寝ました。今朝は七時半に起きて、急ぎました。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C16-D009-S01",
    "C16-D009-S02",
    "C16-D009-S03"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-concierge-7",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 52.372,
   "end_sec": 58.414,
   "duration_sec": 6.042
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C16-D010",
   "turn_index": 9,
   "speaker": "マテオ",
   "source_text": "私は昨日しました。今日は朝の準備も終わりましたから、一緒に文章を読みませんか。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C16-D010-S01",
    "C16-D010-S02"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-commercial-4",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 58.764,
   "end_sec": 64.305,
   "duration_sec": 5.541
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C16-D011",
   "turn_index": 10,
   "speaker": "林梅",
   "source_text": "ええ。この説明の「投入口」は何ですか。駅の機械の話ですね。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C16-D011-S01",
    "C16-D011-S02",
    "C16-D011-S03"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-concierge-7",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 64.655,
   "end_sec": 71.908,
   "duration_sec": 7.253
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C16-D012",
   "turn_index": 11,
   "speaker": "マテオ",
   "source_text": "ここにお金を入れます。最初に券売機の画面で切符を選びます。次に投入口にお金を入れます。そうして、切符を買います。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C16-D012-S01",
    "C16-D012-S02",
    "C16-D012-S03",
    "C16-D012-S04"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-commercial-4",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 72.258,
   "end_sec": 82.309,
   "duration_sec": 10.051
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C16-D013",
   "turn_index": 12,
   "speaker": "林梅",
   "source_text": "私はカードを使います。この読み取り機にカードをかざしますか。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C16-D013-S01",
    "C16-D013-S02"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-concierge-7",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 82.659,
   "end_sec": 87.526,
   "duration_sec": 4.867
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C16-D014",
   "turn_index": 13,
   "speaker": "マテオ",
   "source_text": "はい。これは改札の読み取り機です。カードをかざして、改札を通ります。お金は入れません。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C16-D014-S01",
    "C16-D014-S02",
    "C16-D014-S03",
    "C16-D014-S04"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-commercial-4",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 87.876,
   "end_sec": 94.732,
   "duration_sec": 6.856
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C16-D015",
   "turn_index": 14,
   "speaker": "林梅",
   "source_text": "機械の写真もありますね。そして、説明の字も大きいです。次に駅へ行く前に、この説明を見ます。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C16-D015-S01",
    "C16-D015-S02",
    "C16-D015-S03"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-concierge-7",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 95.082,
   "end_sec": 102.877,
   "duration_sec": 7.795
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C16-D016",
   "turn_index": 15,
   "speaker": "マテオ",
   "source_text": "その写真はリンさんのです。説明は私のです。二人の会話の後で、センターのコンピューターから仲間に送ります。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C16-D016-S01",
    "C16-D016-S02",
    "C16-D016-S03"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-commercial-4",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 103.227,
   "end_sec": 111.078,
   "duration_sec": 7.851
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C16-D017",
   "turn_index": 16,
   "speaker": "林梅",
   "source_text": "二人で一つの案内を作りましたね。コンピューターは廊下の端ですね。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C16-D017-S01",
    "C16-D017-S02"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-concierge-7",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 111.428,
   "end_sec": 116.631,
   "duration_sec": 5.203
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C16-D018",
   "turn_index": 17,
   "speaker": "マテオ",
   "source_text": "はい。私は十一時に帰ります。昼に用事があるから、先に会話をしたいです。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C16-D018-S01",
    "C16-D018-S02",
    "C16-D018-S03"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-commercial-4",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 116.981,
   "end_sec": 122.733,
   "duration_sec": 5.752
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C16-D019",
   "turn_index": 18,
   "speaker": "林梅",
   "source_text": "では、今から二人で練習しましょう。最後の会話はほかの仲間とします。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C16-D019-S01",
    "C16-D019-S02"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-concierge-7",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 123.083,
   "end_sec": 128.541,
   "duration_sec": 5.458
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C16-D020",
   "turn_index": 19,
   "speaker": "マテオ",
   "source_text": "ありがとうございます。時間も少しあります。携帯電話の写真も一緒に送ります。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C16-D020-S01",
    "C16-D020-S02",
    "C16-D020-S03"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-commercial-4",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 128.891,
   "end_sec": 134.504,
   "duration_sec": 5.613
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C16-D021",
   "turn_index": 20,
   "speaker": "マテオ",
   "source_text": "もう一つ、なぜ教室では食べてはいけませんか。案内には理由がありません。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C16-D021-S01",
    "C16-D021-S02"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-commercial-4",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 134.854,
   "end_sec": 141.015,
   "duration_sec": 6.161
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C16-D022",
   "turn_index": 21,
   "speaker": "林梅",
   "source_text": "私も知りません。後で受付で尋ねます。ついでに、来月の予定も聞きます。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C16-D022-S01",
    "C16-D022-S02",
    "C16-D022-S03"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-concierge-7",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 141.365,
   "end_sec": 147.293,
   "duration_sec": 5.928
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C16-D023",
   "turn_index": 22,
   "speaker": "マテオ",
   "source_text": "お願いします。私は家で昼ご飯を食べます。リンさんも帰りますか。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C16-D023-S01",
    "C16-D023-S02",
    "C16-D023-S03"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-commercial-4",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 147.643,
   "end_sec": 152.665,
   "duration_sec": 5.022
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C16-D024",
   "turn_index": 23,
   "speaker": "林梅",
   "source_text": "はい。教室は十二時までです。ですから、十二時に窓を閉めて帰ります。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C16-D024-S01",
    "C16-D024-S02",
    "C16-D024-S03"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-concierge-7",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 153.015,
   "end_sec": 159.141,
   "duration_sec": 6.126
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C16-D025",
   "turn_index": 24,
   "speaker": "マテオ",
   "source_text": "ありがとうございます。窓の右側の紙は今日の予定ですか。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C16-D025-S01",
    "C16-D025-S02"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-commercial-4",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 159.491,
   "end_sec": 164.417,
   "duration_sec": 4.926
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C16-D026",
   "turn_index": 25,
   "speaker": "林梅",
   "source_text": "いいえ、来月の予定です。今日の予定は黒板にあります。今は九時五十五分です。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C16-D026-S01",
    "C16-D026-S02",
    "C16-D026-S03"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-concierge-7",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 164.767,
   "end_sec": 171.858,
   "duration_sec": 7.091
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C16-D027",
   "turn_index": 26,
   "speaker": "マテオ",
   "source_text": "もうすぐ十時ですね。練習に遅れたくないから、ノートを出します。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C16-D027-S01",
    "C16-D027-S02"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-commercial-4",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 172.208,
   "end_sec": 176.913,
   "duration_sec": 4.705
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C16-D028",
   "turn_index": 27,
   "speaker": "林梅",
   "source_text": "私もノートがあります。朝ご飯の前と後の話から始めましょう。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C16-D028-S01",
    "C16-D028-S02"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-concierge-7",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 177.263,
   "end_sec": 182.695,
   "duration_sec": 5.432
  }
 ],
